title: "PitCrowd: a live trading floor in Rust"
abstract: >-
  A 3D open-outcry trading floor in Rust and Bevy (native and wasm) that reacts to price data,
  with paper traders, an evolving pit of strategies and an optional Jev market classifier.
type: software
